Output demos/gifs/voice-sentiment.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set Padding 20

Type "# Voice Sentiment — acoustic emotion detection from audio"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "# Active copilot sessions with live sentiment"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "demos/run-demo.sh copilot-active"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "# Failover + scale status"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "demos/run-demo.sh failover"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "demos/run-demo.sh scale"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "# Pitch, energy, speaking rate — all from raw PCM audio"
Enter
Sleep 2s
